  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Keepers of the old way, hunters are survival experts that specialize in exploiting their enemies’ weaknesses.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Hunters</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Aloy, Horizon</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Aragorn, The Lord of the Rings</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Samus Aran, Metroid</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• San, Princess Mononoke</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Hunter</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The hunter is a low defense, high-crit striker. They can be built for Melee or Ranged positions.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Attack</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Midline or Backline</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Starting Pack:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Scout or Warrior</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Melee, Ranged, Survival</span></p>",
